<tr>
<td><a href="img/gotochi041_001.jpg">
<img height="283" src="img/gotochi041_001_small.jpg" width="378" /><!-- MSComment="autothumbnail" xthumbnail-orig-image="file:///C:/My Web Sites/mysite2/kitanclub/gotochi/img/gotochi041_001.jpg" --></a><a href="img/gotochi041_002.jpg"><img height="283" src="img/gotochi041_002_small.jpg" width="378" /><!-- MSComment="autothumbnail" xthumbnail-orig-image="file:///C:/My Web Sites/mysite2/kitanclub/gotochi/img/gotochi041_002.jpg" --></a></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class="comment">原型製作：KOW<br />
<br />
伊勢海老の水揚げ高は全国で1位または2位。<br />
三重県では多くの場所でおいしい伊勢海老が食べられます。</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><a href="img/gotochi041_003.jpg">
<img height="283" src="img/gotochi041_003_small.jpg" width="378" /><!-- MSComment="autothumbnail" xthumbnail-orig-image="file:///C:/My Web Sites/mysite2/kitanclub/gotochi/img/gotochi041_003.jpg" --></a><a href="img/gotochi041_004.jpg"><img height="283" src="img/gotochi041_004_small.jpg" width="378" /><!-- MSComment="autothumbnail" xthumbnail-orig-image="file:///C:/My Web Sites/mysite2/kitanclub/gotochi/img/gotochi041_004.jpg" --></a></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class="comment">&nbsp;</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class="comment">フィギュアは「<a href="kanto.html#25">No. 25 関東限定　房総半島 伊勢海老</a>」よりも、全体的に赤みが強いですね。<br />
右が本作。</td>
</tr>
